@startuml C1_Manage_VVE_Scenario_View
title C1 – Vessel Visit Executions (Scenario View)

left to right direction
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor Black
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  ArrowColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "Port Logistics Management System (PLMS)" as System {
  usecase "List Vessel Visit Executions" as UC_List
  usecase "Filter / Search VVEs" as UC_Filter
  usecase "Create Vessel Visit Execution" as UC_Create
  usecase "Update Berth / Dock" as UC_Update
  usecase "Complete Vessel Visit Execution" as UC_Complete
  usecase "Consult VVE Audit Trail" as UC_Audit
}

Operator --> UC_List
Operator --> UC_Filter
Operator --> UC_Create
Operator --> UC_Update
Operator --> UC_Complete
Operator --> UC_Audit

note right of UC_Filter
  Filters by date range, dock/berth,
  vessel visit identifiers, status.
end note

note right of UC_Complete
  Closes the execution and locks
  key fields for traceability.
end note

@enduml
